- Added the option to keep macOS, iOS, and iPadOS hosts on the latest OS version (Fleet Premium). Setting `minimum_version` to `latest` along with `deadline_days` tells Fleet to track the newest version Apple publishes for each host's hardware and to set the update deadline that many days after the version's release, so the target version no longer has to be bumped by hand. Configure it in Controls > OS updates, through the Fleet API, or in GitOps YAML. Selecting `latest` requires `deadline_days` and rejects `deadline`; a specific version still requires `deadline`.
